@startuml UC1_UserRegistration_RASD
autonumber
title [UC1] User Registration

' =======================================================
' ACTORS & SYSTEM (Black Box View)
' =======================================================
actor "Unregistered User" as User
participant "BBP system" as System

' =======================================================
' ENTRY CONDITION
' =======================================================
note over User, System: Entry condition: the user opens the BBP platform

' =======================================================
' (a) The user presses "Sign up"
' =======================================================
User -> System: clickSignUp()

' =======================================================
' (b) The system requires the user to fill out a form
' =======================================================
System --> User: displayRegistrationForm()

User -> System: submitPersonalData(name, surname, \nnickname, email, password)

' =======================================================
' (c) Validation Logic
' =======================================================
note right of System: System checks for existing user \n(Validation Logic)

alt User is already registered (Exception)
    System --> User: showError("User is already registered")
else Data is new (Exit Condition)
    System -> System: createAccount()
    System --> User: showSuccessMessage()
end

' =======================================================
' EXIT CONDITION
' =======================================================
note over User, System: Exit Condition: the user successfully registered to the platform

@enduml